+#### Lock, Unlock
+
+Lock or unlock all selected events.
+
+Any event is unlocked by default.
+If an event is locked, any operation that edits, transforms, or deletes selected events ignores it when it is selected.
+Such operations behave as if locked events are not selected at all.
+For example, [free transform](#free-transform) should be grayed out if all selected events are locked.
+The flick direction handles in the main editor field
+and the duration tail handles in the timeline do not appear for locked events.
+
